# Conversation topics for the three slice villagers (docs/narrative/BIBLE.md).
# Offered after a normal chat, at most two at a time. A topic plays its dialogue; the menu then ends.

# ---- Wren ----

topic wren.gossip
  npc wren
  label Ask about the latest gossip
  plays wren.topic.gossip
  if hearts:wren>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 3

dialogue wren.topic.gossip
n0 wren: Oh, sit, sit. Now, between us...
  emote note
  next n1
n1 wren: {Tilda hides the best jam.|Juno burned another clasp.|Piper wrote a song about parsnips. Again.|Bram said four words yesterday. Four!}
  tag funny
  next n2
n2 wren: Of course, it improves with age. Ask me again Thursday.

topic wren.stool
  npc wren
  label Ask about the good stool
  plays wren.topic.stool
  if hearts:wren>=3
  priority 3
  once

dialogue wren.topic.stool
n0 wren: The good stool? Third from the fire. Nobody sits there.
  next n1
n1 wren: Not a rule. A feeling. A very polite feeling.
  next n2
n2 wren: ...It's yours, by the way. Don't tell Felix.
  expr happy
  emote heart
  tag wholesome

# ---- Hazel ----

topic hazel.recommendation
  npc hazel
  label Ask for a book recommendation
  plays hazel.topic.recommendation
  if hearts:hazel>=2
  priority 3
  cooldown 5

dialogue hazel.topic.recommendation
n0 hazel: A recommendation. (Let me think.)
  expr thinking
  next n1
n1 hazel: {if farm:animals>=1}There's a book about a shepherd who talked to her sheep. They never answered. She didn't mind.{else}{if farm:crops>=3}There's a book about a gardener who counted her seeds until the garden counted back.{else}There's a book about a very small field and a very large sky.{/if}{/if}
  tag funny
  next n2
n2 hazel: I'll set it aside. (I already have.)
  emote sparkle

topic hazel.library
  npc hazel
  label Ask about working at the library
  plays hazel.topic.library
  if hearts:hazel>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 4

dialogue hazel.topic.library
n0 hazel: I shelve. I mend spines. I listen to Ione hum.
  next n1
n1 hazel: {It's quiet.|It's mostly quiet.|It is, on a good day, silent.} I like that.
  next n2
n2 hazel: ...Shh. No, it's fine.

# ---- Bram ----

topic bram.forge
  npc bram
  label Ask about the forge
  plays bram.topic.forge
  if hearts:bram>=1
  priority 3
  once

dialogue bram.topic.forge
n0 bram: Forge. Fire, iron, patience.
  next n1
n1 bram: Heat it until it's honest. Then hit it.
  next n2
n2 bram: ...Hm.

topic bram.tools
  npc bram
  label Ask for tool advice
  plays bram.topic.tools
  if hearts:bram>=2
  priority 2
  cooldown 4

dialogue bram.topic.tools
n0 bram: Tool advice. Hm.
  next n1
n1 bram: {if has:resource.copperbar>=1}You carry copper. Good. Bring it here.{else}Bring bars and coin. Two days. No haggling.{/if}
  next n2
n2 bram: Oil it. Always oil it.
  tag funny
